{"ref":"BDB, קוֹנֵן²","hw":"קוֹנֵן²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹנֵן</span>]</big>  <strong>vb. denom. Pōʿl. chant a</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">קִינָה</span>;—Pf. 3 pl. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְקוֹנְנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:32\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.32\">Ez 27:32</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers.), sf. (cogn.) <span dir=\"rtl\">וְקוֹנְנוּהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.16\">32:16</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְקֹנֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 1:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.1.17\">2 S 1:17</a> (c. acc. cogn. + <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers.), cf. (<span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers. only), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.25\">2 Ch 35:25</a> and (<span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> pers.) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:33\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.33\">2 S 3:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.3\">3</a> fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּקוֹנֶנָּה</span> c. acc. cogn., <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.16\">Ez 32:16</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers. v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.16\">16</a>; Pt. as subst. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.16\">Je 9:16</a> (professional) <em>wailing women</em>.","next":"BDB, קִיץ","prev":"BDB, קִינָה²"}